<title>FINLAND: Finnish June industrial output up 6.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish June industrial output up 6.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industrial production adjusted for working days rose 6.6 percent year-on-year in June compared to a six percent rise in May, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>		   June 1997     May 1997   June 1996</p>
<p>		    +6.6 pct     +6.0 pct    +4.4 pct</p>
<p>The average of six economists' forecasts had been for a growth rate of 6.7 percent (range 5.7-7.3 percent).</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358-0-680 50 245, news@reuters@.fi</p>
